      "message": "Use a nodelabel to get the driver pointer.  The DT_INST numbering is not guaranteed by the devicetree model.\n\n```\n\t\tppm_driver_nodelabel: ppm-driver {\n\t\t\tcompatible \u003d \"ucsi-ppm\";\n\t\t\tlpm \u003d \u003c\u0026pdc_emul1 \u0026pdc_emul2\u003e;\n\t\t};\n\n\tpdc_dev \u003d DEVICE_DT_GET(DT_NODELABEL(ppm_driver_nodelabel));\n```\n\nYou should also create macro so this can be shared by all the test cases.\n\n[Example](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/HEAD:src/platform/ec/zephyr/test/pdc/src/tps6699x/tps6699x.c;l\u003d22)",
